  <slide>
    <title>Embed by material id</title>
    <p><alert>How it’s coded · GeoGebra · step 3 of 4.</alert> With a material id the embed is one element. <c>&lt;description&gt;</c> tells a screen-reader user what the applet shows.</p>
    <p>From <c>M13-Mehdi/source/Taylor.ptx</c></p>
