    <title>Manim, two ways: a scene to drive</title>
    <sidebyside widths="54% 42%" valign="top">
      <interactive xml:id="int-slide-secant" iframe="dirderiv-secant-3d-manim.html" aspect="1:1">
        <description><p>The secant through two points of the surface z = 1 + x squared + y squared rotating onto the tangent line as s goes to zero.</p></description>
      </interactive>
