      &lt;m&gt;2\sqrt 2&lt;/m&gt;, which is the directional derivative
      &lt;m&gt;\left(D_{\hat{u}} f\right)_{P_0}&lt;/m&gt;. …
      &lt;/p&gt;
…
</code>
